<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A2.SS0.SSSx6" title="In Appendix B Evaluation Metrics ‣ LD-ViCE: Latent Diffusion Model for Video Counterfactual Explanations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Learned Perceptual Image Patch Similarity (LPIPS)</span></a></li>
